[anyone, "gm_tusk_riders", [
   ],"Tusk Riders are the most traditional cavalry unit you may be accustomed to preferring horse over camel due to their additional speed and maneuverability.  Due to the region we live in and the type of battles we must fight, we have developed a very strong horse archer to counter the speed and agility of other horse archer units who often pick off our camel riders.  Tusk Riders sacrifice maneuverability in exchange for rapid fire from horseback completely removing their saddles to allow firing from any angle using longer bows.  When you encounter a Boar Clan war party, it is typically the Tusk Riders who represent the clan.  We only allow the most trusted of rulers to hire these troops.", "gm_guild_soldiers", []],
